  lines:
  - Hello?
  - OH! You're back! We thought we hallucinated your call. Dr. Bancroft, present!
  - I'm sorry to worry you. The radio tower... needed maintenance. We have a team
    here to help. What's your status?
  - "I\u2019m with doctor LeBlanc, she seems to have broken her leg in a major fall."
  - It was right there. It was going to get me, so I ran and ended up in the quarry.
    I dropped my walkie at some point just east of here.
  - "Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ll send people your way. What\u2019s your walkie\u2019s
    channel number? Do you know Duchamp\u2019s channel number?"
  - Mine is set to 240, and I believe Ash's frequency was somewhere between 446.
    I have no idea where she went thought...
  - She hisses in pain.
  - Careful Anna! Please hurry, before it comes for us.
  - Doctor Leblanc is injured. I should contact the rescue team immediately.
  lineSFX: 06000000010000000000000001000000010000000600000001000000010000000100000000000000
